{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Morning by morning.</b> Every morning, as in כְּדַבְּרָהּ אֶל יוֹסֵף יוֹם יוֹם (Genesis 39:10), and likewise בַּבֹּקֶר בַּבֹּקֶר בְּהֵיטִיבוֹ אֶת הַנֵּרוֹת (Exodus 30:7)." "<b>And when the sun grew hot, it melted.</b> Therefore they would gather in the morning, so that it would not melt in the heat of the sun."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:52.617408907Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}